  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Apache HttpComponents Client 是 Apache 基金会旗下的 Java HTTP 客户端库，提供全面的 HTTP/1.1 与 HTTP/2 协议支持。它包含跨线程连接池管理、同步经典 I/O 与异步 NIO 双模式、多级可插拔身份认证体系、响应缓存、内容编解码、WebSocket 客户端、SSE 事件流消费及 Jakarta REST 客户端适配等能力，面向需要高性能、高并发 HTTP 客户端交互的 Java 应用开发者。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "HTTP 请求与响应处理",
        "description": "提供完整的 HTTP/1.1 与 HTTP/2 客户端实现，支持 GET/POST/PUT/DELETE/PATCH/HEAD/OPTIONS/TRACE 方法，流式请求/响应体，内容协商与传输编码（chunked/gzip/deflate/brotli/zstd），以及同步阻塞 I/O 与异步 NIO 两种执行模式。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/classic/HttpClient.java",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/async/HttpAsyncClient.java",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/classic/methods/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/async/methods/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "连接池管理",
        "description": "提供线程安全的 HTTP 连接池复用管理，包括同步经典 I/O 的连接池（PoolingHttpClientConnectionManager）与异步 NIO 的连接池（PoolingAsyncClientConnectionManager），支持按路由、空闲回收、保活探测、连接驱逐策略等配置。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/io/PoolingHttpClientConnectionManager.java",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/nio/PoolingAsyncClientConnectionManager.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "身份认证体系",
        "description": "支持多级可插拔身份认证：Basic、Digest、NTLM、Kerberos/SPNEGO、Bearer Token，以及实验性的 SCRAM-SHA-256。支持凭证提供者/缓存/状态机，覆盖代理认证与目标服务认证两种场景。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/auth/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/auth/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "HTTP 缓存",
        "description": "符合 RFC 9111 (HTTP Caching) 的响应缓存子系统，支持请求/响应缓存存储（内存），可通过 Ehcache/Memcached 扩展到外部存储。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-cache/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/cache/",
          "httpclient5-cache/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/cache/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "WebSocket 客户端",
        "description": "基于 RFC 6455 的 WebSocket 客户端实现，支持通过 HTTP/1.1 Upgrade 与 HTTP/2 Extended CONNECT 建立 WebSocket 连接，提供文本与二进制帧收发能力。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-websocket/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/websocket/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "SSE (Server-Sent Events) 消费",
        "description": "提供 SSE 事件流消费者，支持自动重连（含指数退避）与事件流解析，可消费符合 SSE 规范的 HTTP 推送流。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-sse/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/sse/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "TLS/SSL 安全传输",
        "description": "集成 JSSE 的 TLS/SSL 安全传输，支持主机名验证策略配置（BrowserCompat/Strict/Noop）、自定义 SSLContext、证书固定等。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/ssl/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/config/TlsConfig.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "代理支持",
        "description": "支持 HTTP/HTTPS/SOCKS 代理，经典 I/O 模式下的完整代理隧道建立，异步模式下的代理协商。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/classic/ProxyClient.java",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/async/AsyncConnectExec.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Jakarta REST 客户端适配",
        "description": "基于 Jakarta REST (JAX-RS) 规范的接口定义自动生成 HTTP 客户端，以声明式的 REST 接口代理方式调用 HTTP 服务，底层由 HttpClient 驱动。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-jakarta-rest-client/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/rest/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "可观测性与指标",
        "description": "可选集成 Micrometer 与 OpenTelemetry，提供连接池指标（活跃/空闲/等待连接数）、请求耗时、IO 字节计数等可观测性支持。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-observation/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/observation/"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "网络通信",
    "target_users": "需要高并发、高性能 HTTP 客户端交互的 Java 应用开发者与服务端工程师"
  },
